-- title:
--   Original predictable negative-band finite-grid compensated martingale sums have integrable mean zero from automatic physical rates and full-band L²
-- statement:
--   For bounded deterministic time grids, measurable negative Borel bands within one physical cutoff and adapted L² weights, the actual compensated Lévy jump-count finite sum is integrable and has expectation exactly zero. Original-process source results discharge every conditional rectangle, count-measurability, finite Lévy-mass and L² premise; no independent physical pair axiom or law replacement appears.
-- source:
